---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Notion's shard mapping before/after the 2023 re-shard: the hash never changes,
// only the table that maps logical schemas to hosts. Inline SVG, site CSS tokens only.
function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${(x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)} ${(y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
const W = 900;
const H = 410;
const arrows = [
  arrow(240, 45, 330, 45),
  arrow(580, 45, 670, 45),
  arrow(320, 250, 500, 192),
  arrow(320, 250, 500, 262),
  arrow(320, 250, 500, 332),
];
---
<figure class="shnm">
  <div class="shnm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Notion's mapping from workspace to host. A workspace_id is hashed modulo 480 to pick one of 480 logical schemas, and this step never changes. In 2021 one Postgres host held 15 schemas, 0 to 14. In 2023 those 15 schemas were split into three hosts holding schemas 0 to 4, 5 to 9 and 10 to 14, so only the schema-to-host table changed.">
      <rect x="20" y="15" width="220" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="users" x={46} y={45} size={24} />
      <text x="130" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>A workspace</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một workspace</tspan></text>
      <text x="130" y="59" text-anchor="middle" class="s">workspace_id</text>
      <path d={arrows[0].line} class="arrow is-strong" /><polygon points={arrows[0].head} class="head is-strong" />

      <rect x="330" y="15" width="250" height="60" rx="6" class="box is-active" />
      <DiagramIcon name="key" x={354} y={45} size={22} />
      <text x="455" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="b">hash(workspace_id) % 480</text>
      <text x="455" y="59" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>never changes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không bao giờ đổi</tspan></text>
      <path d={arrows[1].line} class="arrow is-strong" /><polygon points={arrows[1].head} class="head is-strong" />

      <rect x="670" y="15" width="210" height="60" rx="6" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="file" x={684} y={45} size={20} />
      <text x="775" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Logical schema</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Schema logic</tspan></text>
      <text x="775" y="59" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>one of 480 (0 to 479)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một trong 480 (0 đến 479)</tspan></text>

      <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="105" y2="105" class="rule" />

      <text x="20" y="135" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>2021: 32 hosts, 15 schemas each</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2021: 32 máy, mỗi máy 15 schema</tspan></text>
      <text x="500" y="135" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>2023: 96 hosts, 5 schemas each</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2023: 96 máy, mỗi máy 5 schema</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="155" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Host 1 is near saturation</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Máy 1 gần chạm trần</tspan></text>
      <text x="500" y="155" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Same schemas, moved whole to new hosts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng các schema đó, dời nguyên sang máy mới</tspan></text>

      <rect x="20" y="190" width="300" height="120" rx="6" class="box is-hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={170} y={212} size={26} />
      <text x="170" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="b is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Postgres host 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Máy Postgres 1</tspan></text>
      <text x="170" y="262" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>schemas 0 to 14</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>schema 0 đến 14</tspan></text>
      <text x="170" y="334" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>and 31 more hosts like it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và 31 máy tương tự</tspan></text>

      {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="500" y={162 + i * 70} width="380" height="60" rx="6" class="box is-active" />
          <DiagramIcon name="postgres" x={532} y={192 + i * 70} size={28} />
          <text x="690" y={187 + i * 70} text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>{`New host ${i + 1}`}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{`Máy mới ${i + 1}`}</tspan></text>
          <text x="690" y={206 + i * 70} text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>{`schemas ${i * 5} to ${i * 5 + 4}`}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{`schema ${i * 5} đến ${i * 5 + 4}`}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      {arrows.slice(2).map((a) => (
        <g><path d={a.line} class="arrow is-strong" /><polygon points={a.head} class="head is-strong" /></g>
      ))}

      <text x="450" y="395" text-anchor="middle" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Only the schema-to-host table changed. The hash did not.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ bảng schema-sang-máy thay đổi. Hàm băm giữ nguyên.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why 480 logical shards pay off. Because workspaces map to schemas by a fixed hash, tripling the fleet from 32 to 96 hosts only means moving groups of five schemas to new machines.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì sao 480 shard logic có lợi. Workspace ánh xạ sang schema bằng một hàm băm cố định, nên tăng gấp ba số máy từ 32 lên 96 chỉ là dời từng nhóm năm schema sang máy mới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .shnm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .shnm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .shnm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .shnm text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .shnm .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .shnm .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .shnm .b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .shnm .b.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shnm .s { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .shnm .s.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .shnm .note { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .shnm .note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shnm .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .shnm .box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .shnm .box.is-active { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .shnm .box.is-dim { opacity: 0.5; }
  .shnm .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 5; fill: none; }
  .shnm .arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .shnm .arrow.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); }
  .shnm .arrow.is-strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .shnm .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .shnm .head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shnm .head.is-strong { fill: var(--text); }
  .shnm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
